{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology","id":848028,"title":"[Mystery Cult] PENTECH: Worldwide Leaders in Natural Technology","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-16T00:06:05-07:00","id":848028,"title":"[Mystery Cult] PENTECH: Worldwide Leaders in Natural Technology","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:24px\">PENTech: Worldwide Leaders in Natural Technology</span></b><br /> <br /> </div> <div align=\"center\"><i>Our task must be to free ourselves from this prison by widening our circle of compassion to embrace all living creatures and the whole of nature in its beauty.</i><br /> \u2014Albert Einstein</div> <br /> <br /> Hello, and welcome to our presentation. We are excited to have you here and eager to share our vision of a future without disease, hunger, or even the ravages of age. Here at PENTech we value all life, and seek the betterment of all creatures by perfecting the gifts nature has given us. It's right in our name: Planetary Engineering by Natural Technology. What is &quot;natural technology,&quot; you ask? You'll love the answer! You see, nature is itself a sort of technology, engineered through environmental and biological means. At PENTech, we take this one step further, further enhancing the evolution of living processes by directly interacting with the fundamental components of life. I know, that's a mouthful, right? Between you and I, the backroom bigwigs like to use their big words, but basically, what we do is modify things in a naturalistic fashion. We don't add or subtract, we simply enhance genes already present, or promote growth with our all-natural ReFertilizer\u2122 in areas where vegetation has diminished. What we here at PENTech do is embrace the philosophy that Earth is everything, and nature provides all the tools we need to achieve a better life. Our GAIA program, founded in 1865 by J. Lassater, seeks to ultimately create a paradise on Earth for all living creatures. We can't achieve this through the smogs of industry, but rather through the emissions of a healthy biosphere. <br /> PENTech is always searching for the best and brightest. Of course, in prospective sponsors and employees we desire intelligence and scientific knowledge, but more important than that is <i>integrity</i>. PENTech stands for something larger than just one person, or even one generation. Our mission requires dedication, optimism, and above all, vision. It doesn't matter what garden you first sprouted from, race, creed, nation, or wealth, what we here at PENTech want most is the imagination and adaptability to help us plant a new future. You must be able to envision a world without sickness, genetic defects, and conflicts born of scarcity. The Earth will provide everything we need; we just need to know how to ask it. This way, please.<br /> <br /> This is the Greenhouse. It's sort of our think tank, where we germinate the seeds of an Edenic future. Our Gardeners\u2014excuse the in-joke\u2014cultivate the greatest ideas and send them to our developmental department, where our scientists design and implement new natural technologies. This is where many of our members remain throughout their careers with PENTech. Board members and our scientists regularly visit the Greenhouse to interact with newer members, <i>fertilize </i>new ideas, if you will. Ah, sorry. Just a bit of a <i>dirty </i>joke there. Ahem. Please don't tell my superiors. I might end up in deep fertilizer myself! *laughs* Please follow me.<br /> <br /> Out here we have the real gardens, where we grow fully tested enhanced crops for our think tank. What better to help promote intellectual and scientific growth than brain food specifically engineered to provide the greatest nutrition? As you can see across the field there, we have our facilities, all constructed completely out of our proprietary SolShield\u2122 technology. Every piece of glass is in fact a solar panel! When light reflects through the outer panels, even the inner windows and halls collect small amounts of its energy. Biofuel powers all the advanced machinery within, each 100% constructed of recycled materials. At PENTech we take our mission very seriously. The GAIA program is not a mere job, but a mission, a privilege, and it is something we fully embrace. Everything PENTech does or uses betters the state of the world today with this goal in mind.<br /> <br /> Finally, I wanted to talk to you a little about what the GAIA program is, and discuss our benefits, for those of you interested in joining the team. Gaia is a figure in mythology, of course, but her status as a creator goddess of Earth befit Mr. Lasseter's vision of a better world. He called his idea &quot;Global Advancement of Interwoven Adaptations,&quot; or GAIA. Today, &quot;GAIA&quot; stands for &quot;Green-Augmented Interdigitation Advancement.&quot; I know, more big words, but basically what it means is that we want to employ natural technologies to transform the entire world, which is all connected. You've seen it, of course, with smart phones and international commerce, but also with less fortunate things like diseases that cross international lines or, even worse, war. The GAIA program will end any need for war based on resources, and we believe our message will eventually reach the hearts of those whose roots have been poisoned by theological and teleological toxins. This is why we need people like you: people who are sharp, boundlessly enthusiastic for the future, and willing to dedicate themselves to the cause.<br /> <br /> Ah, I mentioned benefits earlier! Well, let's take a look at the basic roles most of our members will play, whether at the seedling level or at the top of GAIA program's future. PENTech offers unmatched benefits, including health care only we can dream of. Can you imagine living to 175? Well, one of our oldest members just passed his 175th birthday. Of course you won't hear that on the news. Contemporaries like Magad\u2014I'm sorry? Oh, yes, the refreshments are for everyone. As I said, our rivals might argue that only their pharmaceuticals can extend human life, but we managed it with only natural technology. We don't share that knowledge with the world yet because few would believe us, just as you didn't, and fewer still would understand that this is only a small step along the path. When the GAIA program is complete, age will become irrelevant. Our lifetimes will be those of the Earth itself, eternal and infinitely adaptable. Please forgive me if I wax poetic, but I've seen the results firsthand. The person you see before you is the picture of health, right? Once, I was drug-addled and disease-ridden, destined for an early grave. But I had a vision, a glimpse of what the world might be like if not corrupted by weaknesses like the ones killing me. It's how I came in contact with PENTech and joined them. Today I am not only healthier than I've ever been, but I'm completely clean and impervious to disease.<br /> <br /> Gaia may be mythological, but the GAIA program is <i>very </i>real. It changed my life, and it can change yours, too.<br /> <br /> \u2022 <b>Growers </b>are the ones who plant the seeds. This is where you start, and in many ways is the root of our organization. Growers seek out new ideas and innovations that allow us to overcome a disease, a parasite, a logistical issue with crop growth, or even a new medical procedure. Not every seed bears fruit, of course, but what is important that we do not ever stop planting the seeds. They are our future. With every new idea that germinates and sprouts, the world comes one step closer to salvation through natural technology.<br /> <br /> Members gain the Holistic Awareness Merit, thanks to immersion and training with natural technology.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022 <b>Gardeners </b>are one of our most important roles. It is the Gardener's job to take any promising seeds and help grow them into something we can develop in the long-term. This requires constant testing and theorizing, as well as intimate working relationships with our Growers. True to their name, Gardeners cultivate ideas as well as workers, helping continue this natural cycle of growth. As a Gardener, you are also privileged enough to receive fully 100% of your dietary needs through PENTech, ensuring you are as healthy as the ideas you help shape.<br /> <br /> Members gain one dot of the Hardy Merit.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 <b>Green Engineers </b>are the men and women who develop, refine, and implement ideas that grow out of the lower levels. It is their job to test every conceivable modification on a wide variety of flora and fauna, humans included. These are the people who put thought and theory into action. Between us, I like to call them &quot;Greengineers,&quot; but don't tell them that!<br /> <br /> Members gain one dot of Science. This may take them over their normal Skill maximum of 5.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 <b>GAIA Engineers</b> take everything one step further. Theirs is perhaps the most vital role, because they are out there, implementing our natural technology, securing funding, and transforming parts of the world little by little. These are the people who actually bring all our hard work to fruition. And believe me, it works. You won't find any public deals and trades with PENTech, no, because the companies who share our vision realize that many of their competitors do not. We receive funding from our partners and in exchange we give them the tools they need to join the GAIA program. This, ladies and gentleman, is where the future is born.<br /> <br /> Members gain the Inspiring Merit.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 <b>Board Members </b>may conjure images of stuffy old men smoking cigars around a long table. Nothing could be further from the truth! Many of our board members are young and vital, and all of them benefit from the latest advances in GAIA-based natural technology. The board is a highly dynamic and interactive group, working <i>with</i>, not <i>over</i>, the people of PENTech. Their goals are your goals. Their families are your families. Their future is your future. Unlike most major corporations, the PENTech board do not hoard their profits. Each year they funnel millions, the majority of their earnings, into environmental causes and fostering new working relationships. Welcome to the new world of progress.<br /> <br /> Members gain one dot in each of their Physical Attributes. This can take them over their normal Attribute maximum of 5.<br /> <br /> GAIA isn't just a philosophy, or a way of life. &quot;GAIA is Life Itself\u2122.&quot;<br /> <br /> Paradise. Eden. Natural technology. Available only through PENTech.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><u>Secret Truths</u></span></b><br /> Is PENTech truly the philanthropic organization it claims to be? Why, of course it is! Many of our members, such as yourself, ask that question when they realize some of the lies this world has fed them. It's only natural, and here we are all about natural. In fact, we recruited you <i>because </i>you know how to ask questions, to see outside the obvious to a greener future. Our works have opened your eyes, but I'm afraid there are other things out there that want to blind you again.<br /> <br /> Those things you saw attacking the Garden? Werewolves. Yes, that's right. Werewolves. All too real, I'm afraid. I know your mind must be grasping for answers. The truth is this: these creatures are very old and very unnatural. Mr. Lasseter first discovered them the year before he created GAIA, and he did so partially in response to the existence of such aberrations. These creatures destroy our world, tear through the fabric between mortal and spirit. Yes, indeed: a spirit world. What's that? Oh, I know this is hard to believe, and your mind is conditioned to be skeptical. But you know it, don't you? Somehow you've always felt this natural part of you missing, like the world was sick. That's what GAIA is: not just a scientific and medical process, but a way of mending the broken world. Every Garden we grow, every malady we destroy, it helps bring things back into their natural alignment. The world was once whole, but creatures like those terrible beasts ruined it and poisoned our ancestors.<br /> <br /> They are not the only ones. Oh no. We have been studying them for a long time. In fact, more than once these evil creatures have nearly destroyed our movement. But GAIA is stronger than werewolves, or the undead, and so is our devotion to GAIA. Rather than despairing or falling victim to unnatural predation, we developed ways to fight back. Our works make us healthier, stronger, able to see these things that hide from the half-blind public in the smog of the modern world. We have salves for any wound they inflict, cures for any poison. They try to tear us down so that they can go on breeding their unclean race and killing at their whim. For every root they tear out of the soil, or every tree they topple in their madness, ten more seeds are planted. We'll outlast them, don't you worry. We will persevere, because GAIA guides us to become what these monsters can never be: perfect.<br /> <br /> Nor are we alone in our fight. There are many spirits of the natural world, who do not fight in the name of some slavering wolf-god or to satisfy debased cravings for human flesh. They exist simply to be part of the natural cycle. Like the plants of this world, they grow, and like the animals they feed, but they do not die of age. They have been stricken into imbalance the same as we, but while we can bleed, and we can change, they aren't capable of true change. That's why they need us, and we need them. To be whole again. Many of our members enjoy the benefits of a spirit companion, and you will, too. In fact, there is a rather crafty spider spirit that has taken a liking to you. If I remember correctly, you are quite the established entomologist-slash-arachnologist, aren't you? It's a calling, and it's something <i>they </i>feel, too. The spirit of the spider has guided you for some time, and inspired you to many of your breakthroughs. In time, it may ask you to join more completely with it, to regain that missing piece of you. And when that happens, our people can help cement that relationship for you. We have the experts and the facilities where you can put your greatest gifts to use. Maybe one day you will be inspired to join the fight against the Forsaken\u2014oh, those are the cursed ones who call themselves <i>werewolves. </i>The spirits detest them as much as you and I do, for the same reasons: they want to sink their fangs into the throat of our paradise. But they can't.<br /> <br /> The Forsaken will never destroy our cause. GAIA is with us. She will guide us to our true future. GAIA is Life Itself\u2122.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Additional Rules</u></b><br /> Most members have some interaction with spirits on almost a daily basis. Few below the Green Engineer level know it, however. Most Growers and Gardeners simply generate Essence for legions of hungry spirits who congregate in the Greenhouses or other conceptually relevant places. Some, especially Gardeners, have spirits fettered to them, which enhance their contributions of the GAIA program. Many Green Engineers deliberately cultivate fetters, because the spirits help them achieve astounding breakthroughs. GAIA Engineers all have spirits fettered to them at a minimum, and the spirits often have attendant lesser spirits that aid the PENTech member's individual cause. A significant portion of GAIA Engineers are, in fact, Claimed, though all can hide their supernatural aspects\u2014something they attest to the naturalness of their union. All board members are Claimed, and again most can hide their spirit-born traits, or use stand-ins when they must engage with mundane folk. The Claimed of PENTech are ageless and crafty, most inexperienced in combat but capable of interacting with the natural world more fluidly than even werewolves. Nearly all PENTech Claimed boost their Physical Attributes with the spirit's trait dots.<br /> <br /> When combat against threats to GAIA is necessary, PENTech employs its special division: PENTEX Teams. &quot;Paranormal Entity Neutralization, Targeting, and Excision&quot; Teams. These are the warriors of GAIA. Claimed by dangerous spirits of nature and concepts of progress, bearing savage weapons of natural technology, they take the fight to the werewolves ... and any other enemies of PENTech's agenda. In battle they can transform into monstrous forms blending human features with those of nature spirits: plants, animals, elementals, and so on. These transformations seem unnatural, but to PENTEX, they are completely natural. After all, nature is not always pretty. Evolution is a bloody, messy affair. Theirs isn't the majestic metamorphosis of the butterfly, unlike the other Claimed of PENTech, but instead the raw emergence of the raptor from its egg. Highly trained in tactics and combat, capable of deploying anywhere in the world with specialized adaptations for any environment, PENTEX Teams are the world's foremost soldiers in a war against the supernatural.<br /> <br /> <b>New Dread Power: Monstrous Transformation (Claimed Only, \u2022, \u2022\u2022, or \u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> This Dread Power, almost universal among PENTech Claimed, essentially gives the hybrid being two forms. In the human form (or animal form, in some cases), the character displays no overt supernatural powers. For each Physical Attribute enhanced by the possession, only one additional dot is available while in human form. This <i>can </i>take an Attribute beyond its normal maximum, but members are exceedingly careful not to use superhuman levels of ability in public. As an instant action, the Claimed may change into its monstrous form, suddenly manifesting its inhuman traits. The fear and dismay caused by such a startling transformation causes all lesser opponents to use Down and Dirty Combat, if they choose to fight rather than flee. This costs 1 Essence. With two dots, this ability is a reflexive action that costs 1 Essence, and with three dots it may be used reflexively without cost.<br /> <br /> <b>Even More Secret Truths</b><br /> Is PENTech really benevolent? Does it have paradise in mind, or is it a corrupt organization poisoning the world by its actions? It's hard to say. The spirits that inhabit all levels of the corporation are crafty, alien, and greedy, but the PENTech leaders and visionaries are equally cagey. Do they work at the behest of some ancient, forgotten god? Do they have any connection with the <i>Umaraha'e</i>, the mysterious Children of the Worm? And what about their efforts to explore the Wounds and subjugate the dread spirits found within? For that matter, are the spirits of PENTech themselves tainted, perhaps <i>magath </i>born of nature and technology and human concepts?<br /> <br /> The answer may be &quot;yes&quot; to any or all of these. <i>Umarah</i>, if it exists, works on levels so far removed from mortals that no one entity, corporate or otherwise, could hope to encompass its will. Further, the Children of the Worm believe their god to be trapped, bound away from the world, but awakening soon and to terrible wrath. Their goal is to provide the proper resonance worldwide for <i>Umarah </i>to manifest and regain its power. Perhaps without willingly knowing this, PENTech is furthering that goal. Who knows what arcane principles are needed to create resonance for a being so vast and alien? If it is a bringer of balance, perhaps it seeks balance through destruction and cosmic digestion, and so PENTech operates on one end of the spectrum, while at the other the <i>Umaraha'e </i>corrupt the soils that PENTech tills.<br /> <br /> Werewolves and others who seek the answers to these mysteries find secrets as dangerous and ancient as nature itself. Nothing can prepare them for a war with such entities.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":19}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T00:25:22-07:00","id":848032,"title":"","content":"Damn, that's a fantastic Forsaken version of Pentex. The employees at engineer and higher all being fettered or claimed is a horrifying thought. I think I might include PENTech as an opponent of the Cheiron Group in my next hunter game.<br /> <br /> I really like the corporate 'synergistic energizment' buzzwordy style you put into this. It feels like I'm watching a corporate investors pitch video in the lobby while waiting to meet with one of these friendly fellas that sits on the board.<br /> <br /> I'm excited for your next Apocalypse to Forsaken update.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T00:43:30-07:00","id":848036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=848032#post848032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Damn, that's a fantastic Forsaken version of Pentex. The employees at engineer and higher all being fettered or claimed is a horrifying thought. I think I might include PENTech as an opponent of the Cheiron Group in my next hunter game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you so much!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=848032#post848032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like the corporate 'synergistic energizment' buzzwordy style you put into this. It feels like I'm watching a corporate investors pitch video in the lobby while waiting to meet with one of these friendly fellas that sits on the board.<br /> <br /> I'm excited for your next Apocalypse to Forsaken update.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really wanted to nail that style, all while leaving a bit of ambiguity in their statements. Do most of them really believe what they're doing will lead to a better future? And I was thinking of ways to subvert yet update Pentex, or at least part of it, to make it something unique but still recognizable. I ended up pretty happy with how this came out. And the fun part? I really only started thinking about this particular version of it today, a little before I sat down to write it up tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T03:27:10-07:00","id":848061,"title":"","content":"What is with you and pumping out fantastic stuff on the forums. Going to have to follow your account or something to make sure I don't miss anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":274,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","user":"Enokh","date":". 03-16-2016, 10:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","name":"Enokh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T02:42:32-07:00","id":849657,"title":"","content":"Wow.... wow I fucking hated Pentex from Apocalypse. But this, this is something I want to use right away. Fantastic Job, Fantastic Fucking Job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10820-blakemikizuki","name":"Blakemikizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T09:24:01-07:00","id":849760,"title":"","content":"This is awesome, full stop. Will have to find a way to use this ASAP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Pay no attention to the man behind the Storyteller!&quot; <hr /><a href=\"https://www.fromdusktilljawn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">From Dusk 'til Jawn</a> - 2e nWoD game set in Philadelphia<br /> <a href=\"http://www.gravenlore.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Graven Lore</a> - 2e multi-venue nWoD game<br /> <a href=\"http://newhaven.mindrealms.com/\" target=\"_blank\">New Haven</a> - 2e nWoD game set in southern Maine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/951-caelene","name":"Caelene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar951_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T10:37:13-07:00","id":849787,"title":"","content":"I have never been interested in Apocalypse, but this makes me want to play a Forsaken-does-Apocalypse game. Do you have any other translation stuff and/or do you plan on doing more? Because I am all over this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T10:45:45-07:00","id":849789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=849787#post849787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have never been interested in Apocalypse, but this makes me want to play a Forsaken-does-Apocalypse game. Do you have any other translation stuff and/or do you plan on doing more? Because I am all over this.</div> </div> </div> </div>She posted a cult hinting to a worm/wyrm type of entity, with mutagenic cultist and twisted shapeshifters. It's even name-dropped in the above text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T11:40:51-07:00","id":849815,"title":"","content":"Thanks for your kind remarks and support, people. That's why I do this!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=849787#post849787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have never been interested in Apocalypse, but this makes me want to play a Forsaken-does-Apocalypse game. Do you have any other translation stuff and/or do you plan on doing more? Because I am all over this.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/809400-umaraha-e-the-children-of-the-worm\">Umaraha'e: The Children of the Worm</a> - A cult that worships a great worm god they feel will soon awaken and restore balance. They seem to have some proof to back up their claims, too. Also, hints imply that the &quot;body&quot; of this creature, or its maw, at least, may in fact be the Abyss.<br /> <br /> I do plan on writing up some other werebeasts and tying them into this, too, as the other Children come forth when the hour of reckoning draws nigh. I might have a few other things scattered about, and I'll see if I can wrangle them together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T18:32:17-07:00","id":849950,"title":"","content":"Damn... I just realized, now, that you're doing Apocalypse conversions.<br /> ;D<br /> That said, nicely done. I may actually use this somehow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T19:24:40-07:00","id":849970,"title":"","content":"I'm really digging this, but just to make sure my own malfunctioning brain isn't missing something: PENTech is a company? The GAIA Program?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T19:36:22-07:00","id":849975,"title":"","content":"PENTech is a company. Their ultimate goal is the GAIA Program, a method of restoring the world (or what they think is restoring it). PENTech owns many subsidiaries, and has quite a few rivals, as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T20:47:00-07:00","id":850006,"title":"","content":"I wonder what LDI and Cheiron think of them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T20:56:39-07:00","id":850010,"title":"","content":"LDI stands for...?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T21:13:07-07:00","id":850015,"title":"","content":"Last Dynasty International, the mortal bane of the Deathless who are genuinely altruistic. They steal Sekhem from Mummies for the nefarious purposes of making supernaturally effective medicine- no side effects, no evil plots, just super medicine that can restore youth to the aged, cure HIV, and other such things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T10:28:40-07:00","id":850180,"title":"","content":"This is really cool, actually. The original Pentex, while not entirely unbelievable within the context of the Apocalypse setting, always reminded me a little too much of a Captain Planet villain, only Darker and Edgier\u2122. This is a lot more interesting to me because of the ambiguity of their motivations. Nice work!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=850006#post850006\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what LDI and Cheiron think of them?</div> </div> </div> </div>The description is vague, but I suspect that PENTech is involved to one degree or another in biopharmacology; things like gene therapy and synthetic therapeutic proteins produced by genetically engineered organisms. That would make them at least nominally competitors of Last Dynasty, though LDI seems to be more focused on conventional pharmaceuticals. Ultimately, there's little to outwardly distinguish PENTech from LDI's other, mostly perfectly mundane competitors in the drug industry, though the leaders of LDI might become curious if rumors start circulating that PENTech has access to some kind of top-secret anti-aging technology.<br /> <br /> Cheiron, on the other hand, has a vested interest in following up on rumors of weird goings-on in the corporate world, and sooner or later they're bound to discover that one of their competitors is riddled with some kind of supernatural beings. Cheiron also has a particular interest in werewolves, since they would really really like to figure out how to replicate werewolf regeneration, and several of their most successful thaumitechnological implants are derived from werewolf tissues. TCG could potentially stumble across PENTech's supernatural secrets by witnessing a conflict between a pack of werewolves and a PENTech &quot;Garden.&quot;<br /> <br /> Spirits are pretty well outside of Cheiron's area of expertise, but they have an interest in trying to understand the phenomenon of spirit possession, and their lab boys would absolutely <i>love </i>the opportunity to cut open one of PENTech's Claimed in order to figure out how their transformations work. Step one in getting their hands on such an &quot;asset&quot; would probably be a lot of corporate espionage, but eventually it'll be time to send in the Field Projects Division. That could easily go very badly for Cheiron, but at that point they'd presumably have a decent idea of what they were up against, and they'd know to send in the big guns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T10:36:46-07:00","id":850182,"title":"","content":"<b>A plot seed</b> for these guys <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> could be their attempt at generating &quot;cloned&quot; or vat-grown organs for the waiting organs list, with spirits already fettered into them, who would have an easier time claiming the subjects. Cheiron could provide intel to whichever form your protagonists take in an attempt to have them hit the installations with the prototypes, only to discover they're being grown by a bound spirit with the capacity to mass create them. Vampires, specially of the Circle of the Crone could be dragged in if it's actually a big blood spirit.<br /> <br /> God-Machine cults could also be dragged into this.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T11:31:32-07:00","id":850208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Claire Redfield</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=849975#post849975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">PENTech is a company. Their ultimate goal is the GAIA Program, a method of restoring the world (or what they think is restoring it). PENTech owns many subsidiaries, and has quite a few rivals, as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>What industry is it in foremost? Do regular people know the name PENTech? (Insofar as they know the names of other big companies)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T13:34:03-07:00","id":850231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/848028-mystery-cult-pentech-worldwide-leaders-in-natural-technology?p=850208#post850208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What industry is it in foremost? Do regular people know the name PENTech? (Insofar as they know the names of other big companies)</div> </div> </div> </div>IE, is it a holding?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T13:41:14-07:00","id":850236,"title":"","content":"They remind me very much of <a href=\"https://www.thevenusproject.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Venus Project</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T16:50:20-07:00","id":850317,"title":"","content":"Probably biopharmacology, genetic therapy treatments, &quot;all-natural herbal medications,&quot; etc. So, people probably know about PENTech but most of the average people would only interact with them through a subsidiary or a specific type of product.<br /> <br /> I can think of more when I don't feel so crappy. Just had surgery done on Friday and I'm feeling a bit loopy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T17:24:54-07:00","id":850330,"title":"","content":"It sounds like their involved in some agribusiness type stuff too, with GMO crops and fertilizer and stuff. And solar power as well, I guess? I would assume that they have a number of different subsidiaries specialized in the different facets of their business.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-20T17:33:25-07:00","id":850333,"title":"","content":"Basically, yes. Every aspect of environmental science you can think of, and probably a few no one knows about. They're out there, pushing the boundaries, and probably in quite a few unhealthy ways (though you don't necessarily know it from the outside). Despite their outward rejection of teleological notions, it seems likely that the devotion to the GAIA program is far more than the mere physical, even before actual spirits are involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T13:58:30-07:00","id":850795,"title":"","content":"I could imagine TCG abducting people in the ranks of PENTech under the guise of corporate espionage, when it's really just to harvest individuals for the parts. How often do you see incorporeal-corporeal hybridization that's this clean? They're a bounty of potential breakthroughs!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T16:08:02-07:00","id":928935,"title":"","content":"This is pretty amazing. I love that you made versions of Pentex and the followers of the Wyrm that aren't Puppy Kickers Incorporated and The Ancient Order of Kitten Punchers and actually explored the &quot;balance&quot; aspect of the Wyrm that WtF kind of avoided.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}